## Workspaces

| Folder | Holds | Core Constraint |
|---|---|---|
| `/planning` | Specs, architecture, decisions | Task logs must be created under `/planning/tasks/` — never at root. |
| `/src` | Pure computational engines and core math | Pure functions and stateless engines. Must never import from `/ops`. |
| `/data` | Empirical recordings and stable outputs | **Never modify raw data — read only.** Stable outputs go to processed folders; intermediates go to `current_output/`. |
| `/docs` | Documentation, literature, changelog | Architecture blueprints, guides, and historical changelog. |
| `/ops` | Pipeline orchestration, runners, and reports | A script here may read `/src` configs, but must not re-run an engine or recompute statistics. Strict one-way dependency: `/ops` → `/src`. |

**Output style.** Answers in this repo are written BLUF — answer first, plain words, no
preamble. The rules live in `.claude/output-styles/bluf.md` and are activated for Claude Code by
`"outputStyle": "BLUF"` in `.claude/settings.json`. Agents that do not load output styles should
read that file and follow it anyway.

